  <dashboards>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Insight Report'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='2000' minheight='800' minwidth='2000' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='27' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98000' id='32' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='99200' x='400' y='1000'>
            <zone h='98000' id='28' type-v2='layout-basic' w='99200' x='400' y='1000' />
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='3714' id='11' type-v2='dashboard-object' w='11350' x='64650' y='86000'>
          <button action='tabdoc:goto-sheet window-id=&quot;{D0B9A4D6-73DE-4C33-B98E-C9ABAD412DBC}&quot;' button-type='text'>
            <button-visual-state>
              <caption>Back to Dashboard</caption>
              <button-caption-font-style fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#4e79a7' />
            </button-visual-state>
          </button>
        </zone>
        <zone fixed-size='1243' forceUpdate='true' h='69571' id='13' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='65350' x='10900' y='15000'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• The funnel generated 842 closed deals from 8,000 leads, with an overall conversion rate of 10.53% and an average time to close of 49.26 days.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Direct traffic is the strongest actionable channel: its conversion rate is above average at 11.22%, and its time to close is shorter at 30.56 days. It should be prioritised for continued acquisition efforts.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Paid search and organic search show strong conversion performance at 12.30% and 11.80%, but both take longer than average to close at 57.50 and 50.90 days. This suggests an opportunity to improve follow-up speed, lead qualification, or closing processes.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Social and email should be investigated. Both have below-average conversion rates, at 5.56% and 3.04%, and longer-than-average time to close, at 61.85 and 52.93 days.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Display, other, other publicities, and referral fall into the monitor category, with shorter or moderate time to close but below-average conversion rates. These channels should be tracked before increasing investment.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Unknown source has the highest conversion rate at 16.65% and 193 closed deals, but missing attribution limits channel-level decision-making. Improving source tracking would support more reliable KPI reporting and channel investment decisions.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• The dashboard separates volume-driven segments from revenue-driven segments: home decor and health beauty lead in closed-deal volume, with 105 and 93 closed deals respectively, while construction tools and phone mobile stand out by revenue value.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Construction tools accounts for the highest total declared monthly revenue at 50.7M, approximately 6.3x higher than phone mobile at 8.0M, while all other top segments remain below 1M. Its average monthly revenue per deal also suggests that construction tools may be a key revenue-driving segment for focused sales or partnership strategies.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Food supplement recorded 28 closed deals, but no declared monthly revenue was captured.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='3571' id='14' type-v2='text' w='19550' x='10550' y='6857'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='14'>Key Insights &amp; Recommended Actions</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
