                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='1243' forceUpdate='true' h='69571' id='13' type-v2='text' w='65350' x='10900' y='15000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• The funnel generated 842 closed deals from 8,000 leads, with an overall conversion rate of 10.53% and an average time to close of 49.26 days.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Direct traffic is the strongest actionable channel: its conversion rate is above average at 11.22%, and its time to close is shorter at 30.56 days. It should be prioritised for continued acquisition efforts.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Paid search and organic search show strong conversion performance at 12.30% and 11.80%, but both take longer than average to close at 57.50 and 50.90 days. This suggests an opportunity to improve follow-up speed, lead qualification, or closing processes.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Social and email should be investigated. Both have below-average conversion rates, at 5.56% and 3.04%, and longer-than-average time to close, at 61.85 and 52.93 days.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Display, other, other publicities, and referral fall into the monitor category, with shorter or moderate time to close but below-average conversion rates. These channels should be tracked before increasing investment.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Unknown source has the highest conversion rate at 16.65% and 193 closed deals, but missing attribution limits channel-level decision-making. Improving source tracking would support more reliable KPI reporting and channel investment decisions.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• The dashboard separates volume-driven segments from revenue-driven segments: home decor and health beauty lead in closed-deal volume, with 105 and 93 closed deals respectively, while construction tools and phone mobile stand out by revenue value.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
