                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='891' forceUpdate='true' h='12472' id='51' type-v2='text' w='56100' x='42050' y='66554'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Key Insights </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>• </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Overall funnel:</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> 8,000 leads generated 842 closed deals, with a </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>10.53% conversion rate </run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>and an average time to close of </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>49.26 days</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>• </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Prioritise direct traffic:</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>11.22% conversion</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> and </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>30.56 days</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> to close, outperforming the overall benchmark on both conversion and speed. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>• </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Improve follow-up:</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> Paid search (</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>12.30%</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>) and organic search (</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>11.80%</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>) convert above average, but take longer to close at </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>57.50 </run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>and </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>50.90 days </run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>respectively.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>• </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Improve attribution:</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> Unknown source has the highest conversion (</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>16.65%</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>) and </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>193 closed deals</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>, but missing source data limits decision-making.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>• </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Segment opportunity:</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> home decor </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>(105)</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> and health beauty</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> (93) </run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>lead by closed-deal volume, while construction tools leads revenue at </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>50.7M</run>
                    <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>, about 6.3x higher than phone mobile and all other top segments remain below 1M.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
